      "sealed_text": "acceptance_criteria.market_on_open_proxy[4]: no ERROR-level engine log line in either run."
    },
    {
      "deviation": "The documented bwrap command gains --harness-commit, because the isolated run cannot read Git, and --review-record when a retained review record exists; local_source_sha256 remains the binding record.",
